# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of a
# machine's core.autocrlf setting. See GH issue #8.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark known binary/generated assets so autodetection never
# has to guess and a checkout never rewrites their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
